C['intro_add'] = ['You will explain how customer, offer, channel and funnel stages fit together, giving you a simple framework for deciding where small marketing efforts are best spent.', 'You will gather real customer words through short interviews and turn them into an audience profile, so your messages answer what people actually ask for.', 'You will write benefit-led offers with a single call to action and test two versions, learning quickly which wording earns more responses.', 'You will place a chosen search phrase in key page spots and check speed and contact visibility on a phone, making your site easier to find and use.', 'You will build a four-week content calendar and reuse ideas across formats, so you post steadily without starting from a blank page each time.', 'You will gather email addresses with clear consent and send messages that include an honest unsubscribe route, building a list you own and can respect.', 'You will keep a simple weekly tracking sheet and compare cost per sale across channels, which shows where money should go and where to stop spending.', 'You will run a monthly keep, fix and stop review and present results in three numbers, leaving you with a realistic plan for the next month.']
